OL,3,ADanni becomes first contestant to leave
OL,4,ABake Off
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn HGV service administrator from
OL,7,FDorset has become the first person to
OL,8,Fleave this year's Great British Bake
OL,9,FOff.
OL,11,FDanni was eliminated from the Channel 4
OL,12,FTV series during biscuit week after
OL,13,Fbeing told by judge Paul Hollywood
OL,14,Ftheir cookies were "powdery".
OL,16,FDuring the episode, which aired on
OL,17,FTuesday, Danni said they had been
OL,18,Funable to taste the cookies because the
OL,19,Fingredients included cream and butter
OL,20,Fand they were vegan.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
